Subject: [PATCH 167/230] polish(browse): verify post-trim state, fix any
 layout/search/RTL/empty-state issues
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Verified at 390x720 in EN and FA: exactly the big-five leagues render
(no Turkish/Dutch/international teams), rows meet the 44px target, names
localize into Persian, and the layout flips correctly in RTL. Fixes:
- an empty filter result used to fade out into a silent blank panel —
  it now shows an empty state (icon + copy, en+fa);
- dropped the monogram tile whose leading letter doubled the name
  ("PPremier League") — same call the onboarding league list made.

No search input and no Done/Continue CTA exist in this view by design —
it is a competition browser, not a picker (the picker lives in onboarding);
nothing added.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
